Dolphin SDK reconstruction attribution

The C sources and internal headers in this directory, and the headers under
include/dolphin-sdk, derive from the community Dolphin SDK reconstruction:

  https://github.com/doldecomp/dolsdk2004
  commit 2328b4164b1a98422a2255d83ce9a5a7548990cc

The __GXSetVAT implementation additionally derives from:

  https://github.com/doldecomp/dolsdk2001
  commit eb1234c45e6df75757c652c835507ca89674f9a8
  src/gx/GXAttr.c

Credit belongs to those projects' contributors and to the original Nintendo
SDK authors. These are public reconstructions, not an original SDK source
release. Preserve upstream notices and comments. No LICENSE file was present
at the dolsdk2004 commit above; this attribution notice grants no new license.

Local changes were made with AI assistance and verified against the user's
GR8E69 executable. See docs/Dolphin.md for changes, compiler settings, limits
and verification. config/GR8E69/dolphin-source.json records upstream file
hashes and modified files. Only the units listed in project.json are accepted.

The reference headers include facilities and SDK revisions beyond the accepted
release build. Unused functions, debug configurations and unbuilt headers have
not been reconstructed or verified for this game.

The seven GBA units, their two headers, OSFont, GXFrameBuf, dvdqueue, OSInterrupt, OSAlarm and the ClearArena
implementation in OS.c
additionally derive from
https://github.com/PrimeDecomp/prime
commit 693fa74f9a9a7cdbb97f09a09d30853415e40927
The reference project's unmodified CC0 notice is in LICENSE.PrimeDecomp.
The GBA layouts are also supported by the target's preserved GBA DWARF data.
